### Test Pharmacy Order Stock Reduction Functionality
### This test verifies that medicine stock is reduced when an order status changes to "completed"

### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Step 1: Create a medicine with initial stock
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Test Medicine for Stock Reduction",
  "genericName": "Paracetamol",
  "category": "64b8f1a8b5a1234567890abc",
  "price": 10.50,
  "stock": 100,
  "manufacturer": "Test Pharma",
  "description": "Pain reliever and fever reducer",
  "dosage": "500mg",
  "sideEffects": ["Drowsiness", "Nausea"],
  "interactions": ["Alcohol"],
  "ingredients": ["Paracetamol", "Starch"],
  "storage": "Store in cool, dry place",
  "expiryDate": "2025-12-31T00:00:00Z"
}

### Step 2: Create a prescription
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "appointmentId": "64b8f1a8b5a1234567890def",
  "medicines": [
    {
      "medicineId": "MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE",
      "quantity": 5,
      "dosage": "500mg",
      "frequency": "Twice daily",
      "duration": "5 days"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": "Take with food",
  "notes": "For testing stock reduction"
}

### Step 3: Create an order with the medicine
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PATIENT_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "prescriptionId": "PRESCRIPTION_ID_FROM_STEP2_RESPONSE",
  "items": [
    {
      "medicineId": "MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE",
      "quantity": 5
    }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": {
    "street": "123 Test Street",
    "city": "Test City",
    "state": "Test State",
    "zipCode": "12345",
    "country": "Test Country"
  },
  "deliveryMethod": "standard",
  "totalAmount": 52.50
}

### Step 4: Verify initial medicine stock before order completion
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Step 5: Update order status to "completed" (this should trigger stock reduction)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/ORDER_ID_FROM_STEP3_RESPONSE/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "completed",
  "reason": "Order shipped via courier - testing stock reduction"
}

### Step 6: Verify medicine stock has been reduced by 5 (from 100 to 95)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "id": "MEDICINE_ID",
###     "name": "Test Medicine for Stock Reduction",
###     "stock": 95,  // Should be 100 - 5 = 95
###     ...
###   }
### }

### Step 7: Test error case - insufficient stock scenario
### First, update the medicine stock to a low value
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE/inventory
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "stock": 3
}

### Step 8: Create another order with quantity 5 (more than available stock)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PATIENT_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "prescriptionId": "PRESCRIPTION_ID_FROM_STEP2_RESPONSE",
  "items": [
    {
      "medicineId": "MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE",
      "quantity": 5
    }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": {
    "street": "456 Test Street",
    "city": "Test City",
    "state": "Test State",
    "zipCode": "12345",
    "country": "Test Country"
  },
  "deliveryMethod": "standard",
  "totalAmount": 52.50
}

### Step 9: Complete the order (should handle insufficient stock gracefully)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/ORDER_ID_FROM_STEP8_RESPONSE/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "completed",
  "reason": "Testing insufficient stock handling"
}

### Step 10: Verify final medicine stock (should be 0, not negative)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "id": "MEDICINE_ID",
###     "name": "Test Medicine for Stock Reduction",
###     "stock": 0,  // Should be clamped to 0, not -2
###     ...
###   }
### }

### Step 11: Cleanup - Delete the test medicine
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Step 12: Cleanup - Delete the test prescription
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/prescriptions/PRESCRIPTION_ID_FROM_STEP2_RESPONSE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE